# An example of deadline_agent/.env. setup.sh (Linux and macOS) and
# setup_windows.bat create the real .env for you. To make it by hand, copy
# this file to .env in this folder and put your own Gemini API key below.
# Never commit .env, it holds your key (.gitignore already leaves it out).

# 0 means use the Gemini API from Google AI Studio, not Google Cloud.
GOOGLE_GENAI_USE_ENTERPRISE=0
GOOGLE_API_KEY=paste-your-gemini-api-key-here

# Optional. Which model Groot uses. Without this line it is gemini-3.5-flash.
# gemini-3.5-flash-lite has a much bigger free daily limit. See docs/reference.md.
GROOT_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# Optional. When a Gemini model is busy, Groot tries other free Gemini models.
# Uncomment this line to turn that off.
# GROOT_BACKUPS=off

# Optional. A model from another company needs its own key, for example:
# GROOT_MODEL=groq/openai/gpt-oss-120b
# GROQ_API_KEY=paste-your-groq-api-key-here
